<html>
<head>
	<title></title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; min-width: 100%; font-family: Poppins, sans-serif; color: rgb(29, 30, 31); background: rgb(242, 242, 242) !important; height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%">
	
		<tr>
			<td>
			<table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%; max-width:700px !important; padding:0;font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;table-layout:fixed;" width="700">
				
					<tr>
						<td align="center" style="background: #fff; padding:10px;"><a href="https://www.foundit.in/"><img alt="banner" src="" style="max-width: 677.8645446777343px" title="banner" /></a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="margin:0; padding:0;">
						<table align="left" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="fullWidth wrapper" style="table-layout:fixed; background: #f0f0f0;" width="100%">
							
								<tr>
									<td>
									<table bgcolor="#3f006c" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="fullWidth wrapper padng" style="padding:10px 50px 20px 50px; background:#fff;" width="100%">
										
											<tr>
												<td>
												<p style="font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; line-height:24px;padding-bottom:10px;">Dear {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</p>

												<p style="font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height:24px;">Congratulations and welcome to foundit edge! My name is {{{Sender.Name}}},&nbsp;from Customer Success team at foundit. I would like to extend a warm welcome to you as our newest customer. We are thrilled to have you join us on this exciting journey and we look forward to building a long-lasting and fruitful partnership with you. Get ready to witness first-hand the incredible value and possibilities that foundit edge brings to your recruitment needs.</p>

												<p style="font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height:24px;">During this partnership, I will be working closely with you to ensure a seamless and successful implementation. We are committed to your success and will provide you with the necessary resources, expertise, and support to achieve your desired outcomes. Here's what you can expect during this journey:</p>
												</td>
											</tr>
											<tr>
												<td>
												<ul>
													<li style="font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height:24px; padding-bottom:10px;"><strong>Kick-off Call:</strong> We will schedule a kick-off call to introduce you to our dedicated team of experts. We'll discuss your specific objectives, set milestones, and establish clear expectations to ensure a focused and productive output.</li>
													<li style="font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height:24px; padding-bottom:10px;"><strong>Training:</strong> To empower you and your team to make the most out of our product, we will provide comprehensive training sessions. These sessions will equip you with the knowledge and skills to navigate the platform, utilize its features effectively, and understand its full potential.</li>
													<li style="font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height:24px; padding-bottom:10px;"><strong>Configuration and Setup:</strong> I will collaborate with you to have the user email id added to our platform. This will ensure smooth deployment of campaigns.</li>
													<li style="font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height:24px; padding-bottom:10px;"><strong>Ongoing Support: </strong>I will be here to address any questions, concerns, or technical issues you may encounter. We are committed to providing timely assistance and ensuring a smooth experience for you and your team.</li>
													<li style="font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height:24px;"><strong>Evaluation and Feedback:</strong> As you explore and utilize foundit edge, we highly value your feedback. Your insights and observations are invaluable in helping us refine our product and ensure it meets your specific requirements. We will actively seek your input to enhance the solution and tailor it to your needs.</li>
												</ul>
												</td>
											</tr>
											<tr>
												<td>
												<p style="font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height:24px;">Should you require any assistance, have questions, or need guidance at any point, please do not hesitate to reach out me. Once again, welcome to foundit edge! We are honoured to be partnering with you during this important journey, and we look forward to working closely with you to achieve remarkable results.</p>
												</td>
											</tr>
											<tr>
												<td>
												<p style="font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height:24px;">Regards,<br />
												{{{Sender.Name}}},</p>
												</td>
											</tr>
										
									</table>
									</td>
								</tr>
							
						</table>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td>
						<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#101010; padding: 0px 0;" width="100%">
							
								<tr>
									<td class="full_width2 center" style="background:#101010; border-radius: 3px 0 0 3px;padding:20px 10px 15px 40px;"><a href="https://www.foundit.in/" target="_blank"><img alt="" src="images/foundit.jpg" /></a><a href="https://www.foundit.in/"><img alt="foundit" src="" style="max-width: 682.1px" title="foundit" /></a></td>
									<td class="full_width2 center" style="background:#101010; text-align:right; padding:20px 40px 15px 10px;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/founditIN/"><img alt="fb" src="" style="max-width: 677.8645446777343px" title="fb" /></a> &nbsp; <a href="https://www.instagram.com/foundit_india/"><img alt="ins" src="" style="max-width: 677.8645446777343px" title="ins" /></a> &nbsp; <a href="https://twitter.com/foundit_India"><img alt="tw" src="" style="max-width: 677.8645446777343px" title="tw" /></a> &nbsp; <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/foundit-jobs/"><img alt="in" src="" style="max-width: 682.1px" title="in" /></a></td>
								</tr>
							
						</table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				
			</table>
			</td>
		</tr>
	
</table>
